# Normative #542: blocking submission returns only after the initial write
# result, and pumping one receipt retains exact terminal outcomes for all other
# attached blocking receipts. Times are monotonic milliseconds.
#
# A raw VISCA ACK carries no request identity, so ACKs are attributed in
# transmission order and the socket an ACK carries becomes that request's
# socket. Out-of-order settlement therefore appears at completion, which is
# keyed by target and socket together, and never at the ACK itself.
